        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soomjooga ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aniini fuga eaduupcheewi mwammuusi deabalooldaneegwa fuga mideawa guroorooda, geaghus awuurjeewana fuga saseeda, nea goowuurjeewi diibiga Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini ghaabiyeagwa eanooga, meagooneegwa hamita hang'waay; aba gideaba agooga miyoamuusa; asi eara ghamneawa miyoamuusa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba agooga gudabeaha saseeda. Nea iimida jeedeang'wa lachng'eanyiida ea ng'alealeeda, abeeda moowoosi fuga saseeda, nea ghoabeadi fuga gealaani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba iyayi siyagi, “Aniini geabeayi Bawlo,” nea gwayi nuut, “Aniini geabeayi Apolo,” abeeda agooga ea moowoosi buuneeda?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi Apolo ng'eaha? Ama Bawlo ng'eaha? Soomjooga ghayi nung' amwasa gil, gawuurji gidadawda Ng'utamiida giliwas sih gwasin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini ghayi geahisti, ak ghwayiin Apolo beega, nea dea aruudu ea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida hista mii gili ghana siida iin beega geaghus ASEETA aruudu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida hista ea dea iin beega gooyang'deay, amadu gay gaba siisi nyas giimeardaanyi gawuurji gidaghayi sinda gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aseasa geewooschi fuga sin gadiyeeda ASEETA; agooga goowooschi madamnyeanda ASEETA, nea goowooschi gheeda ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba giteena dagheerjeanduumeeda goonan ASEETA, ak geawuurjeewi siida geariir haweewa fuga deekshi geasinyi sindeeta, ak gwadeeksheewa siinuut uhuuda. Ak ea daba siisi ng'ula giteeksheata aba uhuudeaba sindeedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba manda siinuut jea gwasin sindeeta nuut, geaghus diita ghayi nigeawiit eesiniin, nea Yesu Gristohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwadeeksheewa siinuut uhuudeaba sindeedi, iideakta dahaabu, ghana lapiya, ghana lagheanga haw sheayeat, ghana geediga, ghana seenga, ghana nyeega– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gajeataajiit gadiyeemba giliwas sih; aba gideaba gayghoahiimu Eaweedida, aba gideaba gajeataajiida beasta, ak abeeda gwasin beasta gadiyeeda ghayi sisin giduurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gadiyeeda sin siida wassean nea gwadeeksa uhuudeaba sindeetida gayghaghu abeeda gayghwanyas giimearda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida datasa gadiyeadaanyi, gay ghwaak lugooda, amaduuku niny gajeelealu, gay gawuurji gili mwanmwandaawa jeeda beasta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moanali gideaba agooga goowooschi gheeda sibata ASEETA bea ASEETA, ea gideaba Guroorooda ASEETA gwanda jeedeang'wa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida iinuus gheeda sibata ASEETA, gay gwanuus ASEETA siisi. Aba gideaba gheeda ASEETA ea ghaydit, nea agooga gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida adagwareengani geaw. Siida iidaah geaw, gideaba gwandeawa weaghuumeeda aba jeedeang'wa aba gweanyeeksu ea dadashaahiida ak abeeda ghwanyas weaghuumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba weaghuumeedeaba ng'eanyiini leendeeda gil aba heeda ASEETA. Aba gideaba geang'waar, “Siida ang'oonyi siida weaghoot aba jeeda milmilanda nyaawa,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nuut gicha, “Ng'utamiida ghwanal fughareenga fuga weaghoodi gideaba marachi gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi siida wassean adagagwarsa geaw buuneeda. Aba gideaba haleanjeeda sean geagwa gil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Bawlohi, ghanea Apolohi, ghanea Gefahi, ghanea ng'eanyiida, ghanea eaweega, ghanea miyeeda, ghanea haleanjeeda ghamneawa mida, ghanea gea jea ghwahidu gil, suh geagwa sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea agooga goowooschi fuga Gristo; nea Gristo gaba ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
